  m_text: '<size=18><b>Distributed Systems Survey</b></size>


    This survey collects
    student feedback on distributed network latency and cloud protocol efficiency
    for the NextGen capstone project.


    <b>Who can participate:</b> CADT students,
    all years.


    <b>Time required:</b> About 1 minute.


    <color=#0277BD><b>Responses
    collected:</b> 85 / 100 verified</color>'
