  m_text: '<size=24><color=#1B66BA><b>CADT Cyber Operations // Workstation 03</b></color></size>


    Shift
    log: 23:42 ICT. You are logged into your student workstation completing tonight''s
    telecom lab work.


    Campus networks are active. External messaging relays
    are synchronized.


    <color=#B26B00><b>SECURITY ADVISORY:</b></color> University
    networks report targeted phishing campaigns impersonating trusted students and
    faculty.


    Examine all incoming communications carefully. Trust nothing without
    verification.'
