  m_text: "<size=22><color=#0277BD><b>The Ultimate Defense Against QR Hijacking</b></color></size>\n\nEven
    if an attacker tricks you into scanning a malicious QR code, enabling <b>Two-Step
    Verification (Cloud Password)</b> stops them in their tracks.\n\n\u2022 <b>How
    it protects:</b> The reverse proxy cannot complete device pairing without your
    secret secondary cloud password.\n\n\u2022 <b>Action:</b> Telegram > Settings
    > Privacy & Security > Two-Step Verification."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f675742eaf9c20a4f909d78ee7a14fed, type: 2}
