  m_text: "\u2022 <b>Reverse-Proxy Relay:</b> The survey portal acts as a live middleman
    between you and Telegram servers.\n\n\u2022 <b>QR Session Hijack:</b> The QR
    code was an authorization token for attacker's desktop client.\n\n\u2022 <b>Account
    Cloning:</b> Scanning it authorizes the attacker to download full chat history
    and impersonate you."
